OL,3,GNEWSA'Safety in numbers' as women join
OL,4,Arun group in winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA running club in Surrey has had an
OL,7,F"influx" of members in the winter as
OL,8,Fwomen look for "safety in numbers"
OL,9,Frunning after dark.
OL,11,FReigate Ladies Joggers founder Emma
OL,12,FMankelow says "the power of the group"
OL,13,Fkeeps many members running.
OL,15,FMeeting on a wet weekday evening, many
OL,16,Ftold the BBC they had been shouted at
OL,17,Ffrom passing cars or even followed
OL,18,Fwhile out running.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
